<title>USA: Fleming Cos Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Fleming Cos Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY, Okla. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.27		   $ 0.11</p>
<p> Net			 10,322		    4,039</p>
<p> Revs		   3,870,204		4,144,159</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  37,794		   37,675</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.71		   $ 1.12</p>
<p> Net			 26,686		   42,001</p>
<p> Revs		  16,486,739	     17,501,572</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  37,774		   37,577</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: After adjusting for $20 million in litigation charges related to Premium Sales settlement, additions to the closed store reserve and other items, 1996 adjusted earnings per share would have been $1.01. In 1995, adjusted per share earnings would have been $1.00 after an adjustment for the facilities consolidation reserve.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
